      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A somewhat different Poké Ball that has a more\nsuccessful catch rate if used at the start of a\nwild encounter.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "戦闘が　はじまって　すぐに\n使うと　捕まえやすくなる\nちょっと　変わった　ボール。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "有点与众不同的球。\n如果战斗开始后立刻使用，\n就能很容易地捉到宝可梦。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una Poké Ball algo distinta que potencia el índice de\ncaptura si se usa al inicio de un encuentro con Pokémon\nsalvajes.",
